Haoran Liu\textsuperscript{*}, \textbf{Runcheng Zhang\textsuperscript{*}}, Zheni Zeng, Yukun Yan, Zhenghao Liu.\par\vspace{2pt}
\textit{Submitted to ICLR 2027.}\quad {\small\textsuperscript{*}Equal contribution.}\par\vspace{2pt}
