\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=1.16em,topsep=2.7pt,itemsep=2.5pt,parsep=0pt]
\small
\item Proposed MolDAS for multi-objective molecular RL: capability-aware sampling of diverse, learnable inputs; selective oracle feedback on low-probability output segments; and reward-dispersion-guided imitation with adaptive objective weights.
