\item Organized certificate-backed conclusions, missing-support diagnoses, and replayable tool traces so unresolved search is not confused with a logically established answer.
\end{rSubsection}

\begin{rSubsection}{Tangut-SPAR: Structured Proxy Augmentation and Reliable Preference Tuning}{2026}{Low-resource language modeling \quad | \quad \cvsmalllink{https://www.runnelzhang.com/posters/tangut-spar}{Poster}}{}
